# Sample per-genre fallback.
#
# Loaded when the matcher's per-track lookup fails AND the now-playing
# backend reports a genre that slugifies to "metal" (case-insensitive,
# accents folded). Sits between the per-track tier (always wins) and
# `_default.cues` (last-resort).
#
# Edit to taste. The shipping example is a deep purple wash with a
# faster sparkle-on-beat cadence than the global default, in keeping
# with the genre.
#
# Slug rule: file is `_default_<genre-slug>.cues`. Multi-word genres
# use hyphens: e.g. "Alternative Rock" -> `_default_alternative-rock.cues`.

@bpm        140
@default_fx quiet_wash 80 0 160
@ShowSongInfo
